<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1352565898"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1453639204"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Fragile"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="DJ OKAWARI / Celeina Ann"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Nightfall"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:44.950"><div begin="00:19.280" end="03:44.950"><p begin="00:19.280" end="00:24.530" itunes:key="L1">There are some times that I forget to be breathing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时候我会忘记呼吸</span></p><p begin="00:24.530" end="00:29.280" itunes:key="L2">And it's like I'm drowning in the middle of the sea<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛沉溺在苍茫大海</span></p><p begin="00:29.280" end="00:34.350" itunes:key="L3">I don't know why I get these complicated feelings<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知为何会有如此复杂的情绪</span></p><p begin="00:34.350" end="00:39.330" itunes:key="L4">I go so high and low, and in outer space<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浮浮沉沉 仿佛身处外太空</span></p><p begin="00:39.330" end="00:44.170" itunes:key="L5">People say that it's okay to feel this pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说没关系的</span></p><p begin="00:44.170" end="00:49.070" itunes:key="L6">They say life is just a game, it's easy to say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说人生不过是一场游戏</span></p><p begin="00:49.070" end="00:53.950" itunes:key="L7">Deep down inside, I know I will survive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心深处 我知道</span></p><p begin="00:53.950" end="00:57.660" itunes:key="L8">But is it too much to ask?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我的要求很多吗</span></p><p begin="00:57.660" end="01:00.360" itunes:key="L9">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="01:00.360" end="01:02.650" itunes:key="L10">It's like a dream living a moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像做了一场美梦</span></p><p begin="01:02.650" end="01:05.360" itunes:key="L11">Then everything's gone in a second<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醒来后一切都消失不见</span></p><p begin="01:05.360" end="01:07.420" itunes:key="L12">Hoping that it's the last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望这是最后一次</span></p><p begin="01:07.420" end="01:09.990" itunes:key="L13">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="01:09.990" end="01:12.530" itunes:key="L14">I see a red light ahead us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见前方亮起了红灯</span></p><p begin="01:12.530" end="01:15.050" itunes:key="L15">Stuck in this moment of chaos<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们被困在这混乱的时刻</span></p><p begin="01:15.050" end="01:17.240" itunes:key="L16">Tell me that it's the last night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 这是最后一个夜晚</span></p><p begin="01:17.240" end="01:22.180" itunes:key="L17">Come here, won't you hold my hand? Oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="01:22.180" end="01:27.930" itunes:key="L18">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="01:27.930" end="01:33.220" itunes:key="L19">There is a darkness that I keep on hiding<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黑暗深埋在我心底</span></p><p begin="01:33.220" end="01:37.640" itunes:key="L20">It terrifies me in the middle of my sleep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我从睡梦中惊醒</span></p><p begin="01:37.640" end="01:42.900" itunes:key="L21">Show me the world breathing in a deep silence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感受这寂静世界的呼吸</span></p><p begin="01:42.900" end="01:47.880" itunes:key="L22">The mornin' rise above the horizon, yeah-ay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">地平线亮起来的那一刻</span></p><p begin="01:47.880" end="01:52.770" itunes:key="L23">"There's a light right ahead," is what you said<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见前方有一道光</span></p><p begin="01:52.770" end="01:57.620" itunes:key="L24">Memories still remain engraved on my face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆永存</span></p><p begin="01:57.620" end="02:02.530" itunes:key="L25">I don't know how long I'll go, can't take this no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道会走多远</span></p><p begin="02:02.530" end="02:06.120" itunes:key="L26">Oh, catch me when I'm falling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我堕落之时 请向我伸出援手</span></p><p begin="02:06.120" end="02:08.810" itunes:key="L27">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="02:08.810" end="02:11.290" itunes:key="L28">It's like a dream living a moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像做了一场美梦</span></p><p begin="02:11.290" end="02:13.720" itunes:key="L29">Then everything's gone in a second<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醒来后一切都消失不见</span></p><p begin="02:13.720" end="02:15.940" itunes:key="L30">Hoping that it's the last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望这是最后一次</span></p><p begin="02:15.940" end="02:18.670" itunes:key="L31">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="02:18.670" end="02:21.260" itunes:key="L32">I see a red light ahead us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见前方亮起了红灯</span></p><p begin="02:21.260" end="02:23.720" itunes:key="L33">Stuck in this moment of chaos<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们被困在这混乱的时刻</span></p><p begin="02:23.720" end="02:25.920" itunes:key="L34">Tell me that it's the last night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 这是最后一个夜晚</span></p><p begin="02:25.920" end="02:27.180" itunes:key="L35">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="02:27.180" end="02:30.790" itunes:key="L36">I look up in the sky and I see starlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我抬头望着天空 看见满天星光</span></p><p begin="02:30.790" end="02:33.200" itunes:key="L37">The moon is shining bright<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">月光皎洁明亮</span></p><p begin="02:33.200" end="02:35.630" itunes:key="L38">Do you hear my reply?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能听到我的回应吗</span></p><p begin="02:35.630" end="02:38.960" itunes:key="L39">Come here and hold me tight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧紧抱住我</span></p><p begin="02:38.960" end="02:45.360" itunes:key="L40">Yeah, yeah-ay</p><p begin="02:45.360" end="02:48.090" itunes:key="L41">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="02:48.090" end="02:50.320" itunes:key="L42">It's like a dream living a moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像做了一场美梦</span></p><p begin="02:50.320" end="02:53.080" itunes:key="L43">Then everything's gone in a second<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醒来后一切都消失不见</span></p><p begin="02:53.080" end="02:55.180" itunes:key="L44">Hoping that it's the last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望这是最后一次</span></p><p begin="02:55.180" end="02:57.860" itunes:key="L45">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="02:57.860" end="03:00.330" itunes:key="L46">I see a red light ahead us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见前方亮起了红灯</span></p><p begin="03:00.330" end="03:02.830" itunes:key="L47">Stuck in this moment of chaos<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们被困在这混乱的时刻</span></p><p begin="03:02.830" end="03:05.040" itunes:key="L48">Tell me that it's the last night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 这是最后一个夜晚</span></p><p begin="03:05.040" end="03:07.670" itunes:key="L49">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="03:07.670" end="03:09.850" itunes:key="L50">It's like a dream living a moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像做了一场美梦</span></p><p begin="03:09.850" end="03:12.690" itunes:key="L51">Then everything's gone in a second<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醒来后一切都消失不见</span></p><p begin="03:12.690" end="03:14.880" itunes:key="L52">Hoping that it's the last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望这是最后一次</span></p><p begin="03:14.880" end="03:17.430" itunes:key="L53">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="03:17.430" end="03:19.960" itunes:key="L54">I see a red light ahead us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见前方亮起了红灯</span></p><p begin="03:19.960" end="03:22.300" itunes:key="L55">Stuck in this moment of chaos<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们被困在这混乱的时刻</span></p><p begin="03:22.300" end="03:24.570" itunes:key="L56">Tell me that it's the last night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉我 这是最后一个夜晚</span></p><p begin="03:24.570" end="03:29.580" itunes:key="L57">Come here, won't you hold my hand? Oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="03:29.580" end="03:34.410" itunes:key="L58">Come here, won't you hold my hand? Oh-oh-oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="03:34.410" end="03:39.370" itunes:key="L59">Come here, won't you hold my hand? My hands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="03:39.370" end="03:41.900" itunes:key="L60">Come here, won't you hold my hand?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拉住我的手 好吗</span></p><p begin="03:41.900" end="03:44.950" itunes:key="L61">Save me from this darkness</p></div></body></tt>